id: massive-spin
name: Massive Spin
kind: conditions
maxStacks: 1
# Not a Combat Condition: Massive Tornado's beside the Spinning mark, on the same clock. The Sweeping Profile's Magnitude
# is read where an attack's Area is (use-maneuver.mjs).
combatCondition: no
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Spinning, wider: Melee Range 2 more.
text: >
  Massive Tornado: "While you are Spinning, increase your Melee Range by 2 and the AoE of the Sweeping Profile by 1
  Magnitude."

---

[passive]
meleeRange += 2;
